# HU -> material calibration table (GATE-style).
# Each non-comment line:  minHU  maxHU  MaterialName  [density_g_per_cm3]
# '#' starts a comment; blank lines are ignored.
# Density, when omitted, is the material's NIST density; when given, a new
# material with that density is built from the same element composition.
-1000   -900   G4_AIR
-899    -400   G4_LUNG_ICRP
-399    -100   G4_TISSUE_SOFT_ICRP
-99     -50    G4_ADIPOSE_TISSUE_ICRP
-49     300    G4_MUSCLE_SKELETAL_ICRP
301     3071   G4_BONE_CORTICAL_ICRP
